TASK 1: BUBBLE SORT

Aim:
To sort array elements using Bubble Sort.

Theory:
Bubble Sort repeatedly compares adjacent elements and swaps them if they are in the wrong order.

Result:
The array elements were sorted successfully using Bubble Sort.

--------------------------------------------------

TASK 2: SELECTION SORT

Aim:
To sort array elements using Selection Sort.

Theory:
Selection Sort repeatedly selects the smallest element from the unsorted portion and places it at the correct position.

Result:
The array elements were sorted successfully using Selection Sort.

--------------------------------------------------

TASK 3: INSERTION SORT

Aim:
To sort array elements using Insertion Sort.

Theory:
Insertion Sort builds the sorted array one element at a time by inserting elements into their proper position.

Result:
The array elements were sorted successfully using Insertion Sort.